Published build without the test-harness entry points (ADR 003, ADR 015).
link_tmproject_wasm_startup.py --public links with -sEXPORT_KEEPALIVE=0 and
an explicit EXPORTED_FUNCTIONS: the upstream list, the extra exports and the
KEEPALIVE functions of wyd_client_entry.cpp and WydDialect.cpp, minus every
_wyd_debug_* name (UI automation, fake time, camera and item probes). Objects
are unchanged; without --public the link is identical to before.

